            contentEN: "The summer fair was only one week away, and Grandpa wanted to win the cooking prize. So he built a pancake machine. It had wheels, a bell, a big spoon and a spring that flipped the pancakes into the air. “Stand back,” said Grandpa, and he pressed the red button. The bell rang. The spoon poured. The spring went boing! The first pancake flew up and stuck to the kitchen ceiling. The second one landed on Rex, who ate it in one bite. The third one landed on Pancake the cat. “Pancake on Pancake!” shouted Grandpa. Mia laughed so hard that she got the hiccups. Grandpa looked up at the ceiling and smiled. “It just needs a few small changes,” he said.",
